ust-morning-shift","active":true},{"question_id":"1ktebop1v","chapter":"chemical-bonding-and-molecular-structure","chapterGroup":"inorganic-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"medium","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","languages":["en"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperTitle":"JEE Main 2021 (Online) 27th August Morning Shift","permalink":"match-items-of-list-i-with-those-of-list-ii-brbrtabl-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-gitnohpgr436wx6o","question":{"en":{"direction":null,"content":"Match items of List-I with those of List-II :<br><br><table>\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>List - I<br>(Property)</th>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>List - II<br>(Example)</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(a)</td>\n    <td>Diamagnetism</td>\n    <td>(i)</td>\n    <td>MnO</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(b)</td>\n    <td>Ferrimagnetism</td>\n    <td>(ii)</td>\n    <td><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.714ex\" height=\"1.932ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 1199.6 854\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(796,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(c)</td>\n    <td>Paramagnetism</td>\n    <td>(iii)</td>\n    <td>NaCl</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(d)</td>\n    <td>Antiferromagnetism</td>\n    <td>(iv)</td>\n    <td><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" wi