iferromagnetic.</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"content":"सूची-I के मदों को सूची-II के मदों से मिलाएं :<br><br><table>\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>सूची - I<br>(गुण)</th>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>सूची - II<br>(उदाहरण)</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(a)</td>\n    <td>डायमैग्नेटिज़्म</td>\n    <td>(i)</td>\n    <td>MnO</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(b)</td>\n    <td>फेरीमैग्नेटिज़्म</td>\n    <td>(ii)</td>\n    <td><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.714ex\" height=\"1.932ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 1199.6 854\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(796,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(c)</td>\n    <td>पैरामैग्नेटिज़्म</td>\n    <td>(iii)</td>\n    <td>NaCl</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(d)</td>\n    <td>एंटीफेरोमैग्नेटिज़्म</td>\n    <td>(iv)</td>\n    <td><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.45ex\" height=\"1.967ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 2851.1 869.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D439\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D439\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(749,0)\"><g data-mml-no